  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, you can change an avatar's default height by changing the scale of the avatar's gameobject in the editor (and reuploading).  However, if you do this, the 'view position' value will NOT be updated to fit the new scale!  You'll have to scale those numbers up manually by the ratio between the old scale and the new scale.   Admittedly this only takes a moment, but the problem is how easy it is to forget, and also that it shouldn't be necessary at all....\n\nI understand that changing this behaviour might be a breaking change you'd want to avoid, but I think you could easily just add a checkbox to the component, \"sync eye height with scale changes\" (or something), and just automatically doing that math to the view position values when the root's scale changes.",
